    {
        "content": "<p><code>Nonempry.some</code> wants the non empty assumption as an explicit variable, you cannot use <code>_</code>, but you can use <code>obtain v : V := Nonempty.some inferInstance</code>.</p>",
        "id": 594891137,
        "sender_full_name": "Riccardo Brasca",
        "timestamp": 1778686969
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Gotcha, that fixed it! Thanks</p>",
